# BittBoy (Allwinner suniv "F1C" family, ARM926EJ-S / armv5te, 32-64 MB RAM).
#
# DEFINITION ONLY - not built or verified in this repo (see README.md). The
# shared suniv options (CPU, family kernel/U-Boot, gmenu2x frontend, RAM
# trims) live in the common fragment; sources are linked there.
#
# Revisions: covers BittBoy 2 through 3.5 - the per-revision differences
# (panels, the v2 button scan codes, rumble on v3, and the v3 change from
# F1C500s to F1C100s - same suniv/ARM926 core) are handled at runtime by
# the family kernel/U-Boot. BittBoy 1 needs hardware modification even
# under the upstream CFW, and is out of scope.
#
# Self-contained (it selects the architecture itself), so
# generate-config.sh --device bittboy uses it in place of an arch fragment.

include sdk/board/allwinner-suniv/common.config
